  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Layouts package provides a set of powerful layout and container controls including Dialog, Predefined Dialog, ListView, Tooltip, Splitter, Dashboard Layout, Card, Avatar, and Timeline. These controls help structure and organize the UI with features like resizable panels, drag-and-drop dashboard widgets, responsive card layouts, rich tooltip overlays, and interactive modal dialogs. They are designed to simplify page structuring and improve UI consistency in ASP.NET Core web applications.",
